<title>USA: Mesa stake held by BKP Capital group.</title>
<headline>Mesa stake held by BKP Capital group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including BKP Capital Managment Inc, a San Francisco-based investor, said Wednesday it holds 4,738,900 shares or a 7.4 percent stake in Mesa Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently acquired 1,659,000 shares of the Irving, Texas oil and gas production company in the last 60 days at prices ranging from $5.00 to $6.50 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds shares in Mesa for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
